so I wanted to take some reference photos.

295
00:19:16,624 --> 00:19:17,894
Mm...

296
00:19:18,074 --> 00:19:18,894
- Right.
- Yes.

297
00:19:20,594 --> 00:19:21,474
Hello,

298
00:19:21,590 --> 00:19:22,370
Mr. Henry

299
00:19:22,764 --> 00:19:23,554
